3. Requests the Panel of Experts to provide updates to the Committee regarding its activities on a quarterly basis or as requested by the Committee;

4. Urges all parties and all Member States, as well as international, regional, and subregional organizations, to ensure full cooperation with the Panel of Experts and the safety and unhindered access of its members to persons, documents, and sites necessary for the execution of its mandate, stresses that the Panel of Experts should carry out its work in an objective, impartial, and transparent manner, and encourages continued engagement between the Panel of Experts and the Government of the Sudan;

